1
00:00:00,287 --> 00:00:02,827
(Sheldon:)Oh, come on, Leonard...

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,290
(Sheldon:)This is obviously about Penny.

3
00:00:08,587 --> 00:00:09,967
(Leonard:)It doesn't matter.

4
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:13,050
(Leonard:)The woman's not interested in me.
The woman rejected me.

5
00:00:13,217 --> 00:00:15,597
Okay, look. Ahem.

6
00:00:16,261 --> 00:00:19,761
(Sheldon:)You have as much of a chance of having
a sexual relationship with Penny...

7
00:00:19,932 --> 00:00:21,512
(Sheldon:)...as the Hubble telescope does...

8
00:00:21,684 --> 00:00:23,814
(Sheldon:)...of discovering
at the center of every black hole...

9
00:00:23,977 --> 00:00:27,187
(Sheldon:)...is a little man with a flashlight
searching for a circuit breaker.

10
00:00:29,483 --> 00:00:34,573
(Sheldon:)Nevertheless, I do feel obligated
to point out to you...

11
00:00:34,738 --> 00:00:36,778
...that she did not reject you.

12
00:00:37,241 --> 00:00:38,871
(Sheldon:)You did not ask her out.

13
00:00:40,452 --> 00:00:41,832
(Leonard:)You're right.

14
00:00:42,246 --> 00:00:44,076
I didn't ask her. I should ask her out.

15
00:00:44,248 --> 00:00:46,458
(Sheldon:)No, no. Now, that was not my point.

16
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,840
(Sheldon:)My point was, don't buy a cat.

17
00:00:50,003 --> 00:00:51,963
(Leonard:)No, but you're right.

18
00:00:52,131 --> 00:00:54,341
(Leonard:)I should march over there
and ask her out.

19
00:00:54,883 --> 00:00:57,923
(Sheldon:)Oh, goody, we're getting a cat.

20
00:00:59,847 --> 00:01:05,027
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah... No.

